        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: Hawaii Warriors, Houston Cougars, Boise State Broncos, Oregon State Beavers\n- People: June Jones\n- Organizations: University of Hawaii at Manoa, Hamilton Tiger-Cats, Canadian Football League, Mountain West Conference, Pac-12 Conference\n- Events: 2003 NCAA Division I-A football season, 2003 Sheraton Hawaii Bowl, 2013 Hawaii Bowl\n\nFacts:\n- June Jones was born on February 19, 1953.\n- June Jones is an American football coach and former player.\n- June Jones was serving as the head coach of the Hamilton Tiger-Cats of the Canadian Football League.\n- The 2003 Hawaii Warriors football team represented the University of Hawaii at Manoa in the 2003 NCAA Division I-A football season.\n- Under head coach June Jones, the 2003 Hawaii Warriors football team completed its second straight winning season and its fourth winning season in five seasons.\n- The 2003 Hawaii Warriors football team ended its season with a bowl win.\n- The 2003 Sheraton Hawaii Bowl matched the hometown Hawaii Warriors with the Houston Cougars.\n- The 2013 Hawaii Bowl was the twelfth edition of the Hawaii Bowl.\n- The 2013 Hawaii Bowl featured the Boise State Broncos from the Mountain West Conference against the Oregon State Beavers from the Pac-12 Conference.",
